Spider Sign was added in '''Beta 46.0''', as a 7G 6/6 [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Epic Epic] [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Arachnid Arachnid] that would transform all [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Spider Spiders] in your deck into Spider Croissants and Spider Donuts randomly, with a 50/50 chance. '''Beta 52.0''' also made it transform Spiders in your hand.

=== Stats ===
ATK: 6

HP: 6

Cost: 7

Abilities:
*Magic: Randomly turn into Spider Croissants and Spider Donuts ...
**all Spiders in your deck. (Post Beta 46.0)
**all Spiders in your deck and hand. (Post Beta 52.0, Current)
Rarity: Purple (Rare)
